# Raw microSD binary logs (log0 .. log9999, no extension).
# Only the extension-less originals are ignored; everything derived from them
# (*.csv, *.png, *.gif) stays tracked. Regenerate CSVs with
# chamber/log_to_csv_chamber.py or usd/log_to_csv.py.
log[0-9]
log[0-9][0-9]
log[0-9][0-9][0-9]
log[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]
